content.text:
The evidence points to one fault: ts-travel-plan-service rewrites the status of its successful train-service calls to 401, and that turns its own responses into 500s for the dashboard. The network and restart signals are unchanged, so I'm not naming any other fault.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_wrong_status_code",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, p.attr_http_response_status_code caller_code, c.service_name callee, c.attr_http_response_status_code callee_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name = 'ts-travel-plan-service' AND p.attr_span_kind = 'Client' AND c.service_name = 'ts-train-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "766 travel-plan client GET calls to train-service recorded 401 while train-service's server spans returned 200."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'ts-travel-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind = 'Server' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Travel-plan's own server spans for cheapest, minStation and quickest returned 500 with error status in abnormal period."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name = 'ts-travel-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind = 'Client' AND span_name = 'GET' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "In normal period the same travel-plan GET client spans all returned 200."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-travel-plan-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, p.attr_http_response_status_code caller_code, c.attr_http_response_status_code callee_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name = 'ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name = 'ts-travel-plan-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "ui-dashboard requests to travel-plan's cheapest, minStation and quickest endpoints return 500 in abnormal period, carrying the travel-plan failure to users."}]}
  ]
}
```

